=== The Gate of All Nations

<figure
  <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/The_stone_columns_of_the_Gate_of_All_Nations%2C_they_were_16%C2%BD_meters_high_and_were_topped_with_capitals_in_the_form_of_a_double_bull%2C_Persepolis%2C_Iran_%2847779521811%29.jpg/250px-thumbnail.jpg" height="287" width="190"

  <figcaption>The stone columns of the [[ Gate of All Nations ]], they are 16½ meters high and were topped with capitals in the form of a double bull.

The [[ Gate of All Nations ]], referring to subjects of the empire, consisted
of a grand hall that was a square of approximately 25 m (82 ft) in length,
with four columns and its entrance on the Western Wall.

