=== Other palaces and structures

The Council Hall, the Tryplion Hall, the Palaces of D, G, H, storerooms,
stables and quarters, the unfinished gateway and a few miscellaneous
structures at Persepolis are located near the south-east corner of the
terrace, at the foot of the mountain.

